  "text": "Veterinary Hospital | CATDOG Hospital | Giza Governorate\ntop of page\nCALL US:   (+20) 103 228 8638\nHome\nAbout Us\nBook Online\nShop\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nAt CatDog Hospital\nWe Take Care Of Your Loving Pet\nFull service animal hospital providing care to the pets of 6th of October City and surrounding areas of Cairo and Giza since 2018.\nLearn More\nHome: Welcome\n​\n​\nFollow us on Instagram\n#wix\n@wix\nLoad More\nOPENING HOURS\nCome Visit\nSaturday     : 10am - 6pm\nSunday       : 10am - 6pm\nMonday      : 10am - 6pm\nTuesday      : 10am - 6pm\nWednesday : 10am - 6pm\nThursday     : 10am - 6pm\nFriday          : Closed\nHome: Opening Hours\nContact Us\nEMERGENCY CARE SERVICES\nAvailable 24/7\nHome: Services\nAll Videos\nComing Soon\nSearch videos\nSearch video...\nAll Categories\nAll Categories\nThis channel is coming soon!\nHome: Video\nHome: Instagram\nCONTACT US\nWe consider all pets as friends, and we can’t wait to meet yours! Call today to make an appointment, or just stop by.\n163 10th street, 5th District, 6th of October City, Giza Governorate, 12566\nMaidaaMira@catdoghospital.com\n(+20) 103 228 8638\nHome: Contact\n©2025 by CatDog Hospital. All rights reserved.\nbottom of page",
